     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Shop High-Quality CBD Products on Cape Cod! </strong>Looking for the benefits of cannabis without the high? Browse our curated selection of premium CBD products at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet. From tinctures and topicals to edibles and flower, our CBD offerings are perfect for relaxation, relief, and daily wellness—without the psychoactive effects of THC.</p>",
