   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "faq",
     "kind": "nested-accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "CLICK TO VIEW CBD FAQ'S",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "faq",
         "kind": "nested-accordion",
         "items": [
          {
           "q": "What is CBD and why do people choose it?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>CBD is a naturally occurring compound found in the cannabis plant that many people use as part of a wellness or relaxation routine. Customers often choose CBD for its calming properties and because it does not produce intoxicating effects, making it a popular option for both new and experienced shoppers.</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Can I purchase CBD products at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>Yes. Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet offers a selection of CBD-focused products designed to support relaxation, balance, and everyday wellness. Our knowledgeable staff can help guide you through available options and answer questions to help you make an informed choice.</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Do I need to be 21 or older to buy CBD at Cape Cod Cannabis?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>Yes. In accordance with Massachusetts regulations, all customers must be <strong>21 years of age or older</strong> to purchase any products at Cape Cod Cannabis, including CBD. A valid government-issued photo ID is required at entry.</p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Are CBD products a good option for first-time shoppers or visitors to Cape Cod?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>Many first-time shoppers and Cape Cod visitors choose CBD products because they are approachable and easy to incorporate into a daily routine. CBD options are often selected by those looking for a more subtle experience, and our team is happy to provide recommendations based on your preferences.</p>"
            }
           ]
          }
         ],
